{"overview":"Eva has just gotten married to an older gentleman, but discovers that he is obsessed with order in his life and doesn't have much room for passion. She becomes despondent and leaves him, returning to her father's house. One day while bathing in the lake, she meets a young man and they fall in love. The husband has become grief stricken at the loss of his young bride, and fate brings him together with the young lover that has taken Eva from him.","cast":[{"n":"Hedy Lamarr","c":"Eva Hermann","p":"/qH15pDp99SXcMIuGFV7fU1x4Wqt.jpg","q":"Q49034"},{"n":"Zvonimir Rogoz","c":"Emil","p":"/n5HyEH2GTxABbG7rCmzAxPy5srI.jpg","q":"Q1566610"},{"n":"Aribert Mog","c":"Adam","p":null,"q":"Q97406"},{"n":"Leopold Kramer","c":"Evas Vater","p":"/uoMqprmjUADwmvI37PtQ1RIer3k.jpg","q":"Q115028"},{"n":"Emily Jerman","c":"Evas Ehemann (voice)","p":null,"q":null},{"n":"Eduard Šlégl","c":"Landarbeiter","p":"/iyYzDk2vrjsiWhVztNmk8nbTRKX.jpg","q":"Q95900241"},{"n":"Antonín Kubový","c":"Landarbeiter","p":null,"q":"Q94854484"},{"n":"Jan Sviták","c":"Tänzer","p":"/lBzK7Bq23T70ab9s0nZqJAh8SSa.jpg","q":"Q3161763"},{"n":"Bedřich Vrbský","c":"Evas Vater (voice)","p":"/joFWhGuTZpnBMs7OPt5GTWOQAid.jpg","q":"Q11066264"},{"n":"Jiřina Štěpničková","c":"Eva (voice)","p":"/efr6pETFxijSyCj61ZaktjifpTS.jpg","q":"Q6203607"}],"country":["Austria","Czechoslovakia"],"language":["German"],"wiki":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ecstasy_(film)","qid":"Q369346","rel":{"AT":{"d":"1933-02-18"},"CZ":{"d":"2020-01-23"},"DE":{"d":"1935-01-08"},"FR":{"d":"1933-03-28"},"SE":{"d":"1933-10-09","c":"15"},"XC":{"d":"1933-01-18"}},"backdrops":["/7Zp1OVZEaEfpya2XjZ7qAZFDTqo.jpg","/prYOxMXcWhFOOT7qvD9eldgwP0j.jpg","/fJlmuteVveQc46ItJKRQKj06FNq.jpg","/k5voF5xUUwjb5zoIngbuLJIYRkd.jpg","/1sU6hs6HY5rTU9LHKAeEPNmMLd.jpg","/hh42g6nHq8z29fwzBSwmekCnAOr.jpg","/aUWzzmWuOANbkhjTqFEFgO4h7k5.jpg","/lCEd9llEJwh0DFxx0fbco0fUvbh.jpg"]}